      "value": "I already used KeePassXC as my password manager, so it was easy to enable its global-auto type in its settings, enable auto-type for my VRChat entry, set the window association to VRChat, the specific sequence to {USERNAME}{ENTER}{DELAY 500}{PASSWORD}{ENTER} and now I just type a keybind, it types it in, and logs in without involving a third party macro tool.",
